r integrating biomarkers into population-based research.</article-title><source>Demography</source><volume>44</volume><fpage>899</fpage><lpage>925</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18232218</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005321-Skogstrand1"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Skogstrand</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Thorsen</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>N&#x000f8;rgaard-Pedersen</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Schendel</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name><name><surname>S&#x000f8;rensen</surname><given-names>LC</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Simultaneous measurement of 25 inflammatory markers and neurotrophins in neonatal dried blood spots by immunoassay with xMAP technology.</article-title><source>Clin Chem</source><volume>51</volume><fpage>1854</fpage><lpage>1866</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16081507</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005321-Jeffrey1"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="other"><collab>Jeffrey Modell Foundation breaking news: Newborn screening for primary immunodeficiencies</collab><year>2009</year><comment><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.info4pi.org/newsletters_publications/index.cfm?section=newspubs&#x00026;content=breakingnews&#x00026;newsid=197&#x00026;CFID=32118322&#x00026;CFTOKEN=51295278">http://www.info4pi.org/newsletters_publications/index.cfm?section=newspubs&#x00026;content=breakingnews&#x00026;newsid=197&#x00026;CFID=32118322&#x00026;CFTOKEN=51295278</ext-link> Accessed 13 January 2009</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005321-Janzi1"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Janzi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Odling</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Pan-Hammarstr&